  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nX : 30 :: 175 : Y\n\nSo, replacing 'X' and 'Y' in each option one by one:\n\nOption 1) X = 195, Y = 27 ⇒ 195 : 30 :: 175 : 27\n\n__30 × 5__ + 10 = 195\n\n__150 + 10__ = 195\n\n160 ≠ 195 (LHS ≠ RHS);\n\n__27 × 5__ + 10 = 175\n\n__135 + 10__ = 175\n\n145 ≠ 175 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) X = 145, Y = 38 ⇒ 145 : 30 :: 175 : 38\n\n__30 × 5__ + 10 = 145\n\n__150 + 10__ = 145\n\n160 ≠ 145 (LHS ≠ RHS);\n\n__38 × 5__ + 10 = 175\n\n__190 + 10__ = 175\n\n200 ≠ 175 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) X = 160, Y = 33 ⇒ 160 : 30 :: 175 : 33\n\n__**30 × 5**__ + 10 = 160\n\n__**150 + 10**__ = 160\n\n**160 = 160 (LHS = RHS**);\n\n__33 × 5__ + 10 = 175\n\n__165 + 10__ = 175\n\n**175 = 175 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 4) X = 180, Y = 44 ⇒ 180 : 30 :: 175 : 44\n\n__30 × 5__ + 10 = 180\n\n__150 + 10__ = 180\n\n160 ≠ 180 (LHS ≠ RHS);\n\n__44 × 5__ + 10 = 175\n\n__220 + 10__ = 175\n\n230 ≠ 175 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
